build/*
dist/*
**/*.egg-info/*
.idea/*
**/*.yaml
!config/weaviate_collections.yaml
.env
**/__pycache__/*
# Generated agent-graph renders. The rule used to be `test/*.png`; that directory
# was renamed to test_scripts_agents/, which silently un-ignored six of them.
test_scripts_agents/*.png
# Anchored to the root: test_scripts_agents/program_graph.mmd is tracked, and an
# unanchored pattern matches at any depth, so it would silently start ignoring
# that file the moment anyone untracked it.
/program_graph.png
/program_graph.mmd
test_output/

test_scripts_internal
planning_internal


.DS_Store
logs

test_data_internal

planning
notes
kgraphplanner_orig/
# Anchored: these name top-level directories, and unanchored patterns match at
# any depth. Bare `config` also matched kgraphplanner/config/, the package that
# holds AgentConfig -- its files are tracked so nothing broke, but a NEW file
# added there would have been silently ignored.
/config
/bin

